{"unit_id":"QWQ-nn__dsh-client-ui-trajectory-categories#card-zh","repo":"QWQ-nn/dsh-client-ui-trajectory-categories","commit":"652f159b6087197160e7e3238819db94e0a3de63","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-trajectory-categories 是面向 DSH Web 的轨迹分类视图插件。它在会话视图中注册「分类」标签，读取 ui-trajectory 提供的轨迹投影，并在浏览器端整理消息、工具调用和压缩事件。用户可以查看各类工具动作的计数与记录、按名称或内容筛选、展开参数和结果，也可以用日期热力图浏览活动。流程画布按问题展示方案、工具调用、错误和完成状态，并支持拖动、缩放及切换问题。适合希望在 Web 会话中快速浏览工具活动和执行过程的用户；需要同时安装提供轨迹投影的 ui-trajectory 插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:674-717","lib/client.js:1576-1599"]}
{"unit_id":"QWQ-nn__dsh-client-ui-trajectory-categories#card-en","repo":"QWQ-nn/dsh-client-ui-trajectory-categories","commit":"652f159b6087197160e7e3238819db94e0a3de63","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-client-ui-trajectory-categories adds a Categories tab to DSH Web conversations. It groups trajectory events into action counts, offers filtering and detail expansion, and shows per-problem attempts and tool steps on an interactive canvas. It uses the ui-trajectory projection.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:674-717","lib/client.js:1576-1599"]}
